d_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"DH_aRlDhnzsJTh1ffWwt_Q","review_id":"TLdAguWk0Lt8PYjKF_HlQA","date":"2015-04-22T21:42:09","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9377137422561646,"text_excerpt":"I'm not vegan or even vegetarian and definitely not a super healthy eater much of the time, but I decided try Superfood Bar today mostly out of curiosity and was very pleasantly surprised. The place is small and simple, but the service was very friendly and quick. I ordered the Superfood Bar salad to go and it was really good and surprisingly filling. I was dubious at first, but all the ingredients were really fresh and the coconut bacon was as awesome as everyone says it is. The place seems dedicated to what they do. They had a white board up with some info about the juicing process to clear up some false info. I didn't think the prices were too bad. I'll definitely be back to try to som..."},{"business_id":"DH_aRlDhnzsJTh1ffWwt_Q","review_id":"_eV7F6Wbl5OS7SesoB5E4Q","date":"2013-06-13T14:57:51","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9332886934280396,"text_excerpt":"Superfood Bar is truly unique in this city. The two best smoothies I have had are the Green Pineapple and the Tropical Maca. They have options for healthy proteins as well (no whey! yay!). I have ordered their raw pizza in the past, and it was incredible. Their new seating area is clean and bright, I'm super happy they were able to expand! I'd definitely suggest stopping by for some flavorful foods!"},{"business_id":"DH_aRlDhnzsJTh1ffWwt_Q","review_id":"zcmZPoAQKf0l4lfPTMRqxg","date":"2013-09-26T17:02:43","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9312676787376404,"text_excerpt":"I have been on the \"hunt\" for an avocado smoothie for a while now. I have heard they are the hot new thing because avocados are super good for you and rather than take the time to buy avocados and make my own, I just wanted to buy one somewhere. Seems reasonable? Anyway, when Joi B. posted a picture of hers on instagram and mentioned that she got it at Superfood Bar, I knew I had to check this place out. I wasn't disappointed at all. The place is small, but was easy to find. They have a lot of \"raw\" foods, and as you would expect, everything is super healthy. I got my \"simple\" avocado smoothie which comes in one size- 16oz. It was fantastic! First of all, it is basically a cup of pureed a..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"DH_aRlDhnzsJTh1ffWwt_Q","photo_id":"35uor8YC2malnJEoAkcl9A","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/35uor8YC2malnJEoAkcl9A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8720122575759888},{"business_id":"DH_aRlDhnzsJTh1ffWwt_Q","photo_id":"moyuvZbAWU5m92T_n0FInA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/moyuvZbAWU5m92T_n0FInA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8606371879577637},{"business_id":"DH_aRlDhnzsJTh1ffWwt_Q","photo_id":"yaW4f4niwk6PUTfVOgZYrQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/yaW4f4niwk6PUTfVOgZYrQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8577747941017151},{"business_id":"DH_aRlDhnzsJTh1ffWwt_Q","photo_id":"v1brBS7juhaP1YkXLp7ZQA","label":"menu","image_url":"/photos/v1brBS7juhaP1YkXLp7ZQA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8432234525680542},{"business_id":"DH_aRlDhnzsJTh1ffWwt_Q","photo_id":"uqF5GpKGHey8WUYCV7cGbQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/uqF5GpKGHey